# Environment & URL Management

- Do not hardcode API or socket URLs.
- Read environment keys through centralized environment config.
- Keep environment switching in `AppConfig`.
- Access runtime URLs through `UrlService` only.
- Do not call `dotenv` from UI, BLoC, or repository layers.
- Do not construct base URLs in feature code.
